# Code owners for APRF

Working-draft phase: review is coordinated by repository maintainers and the interim stewardship contact in `spec/aprf-spec.json` (`stewardship.participation.contact`).

When interim advisory seats are filled, add GitHub team handles here (for example `@stackrail-io/aprf-stewards`) so required reviews apply automatically.

Until then this file intentionally has **no enforced owner pattern**, so PRs are not blocked on a missing team.
